# Source for s2-ehz2-boss-crowd.txt (InputLogAuthorTool --script). Emerald Hill act 2,
# positioned at x 10150 y 1000 with a chain of twelve Sonic sidekicks: walk into the
# boss arena (camera lock at x 10480-10560), then pace between the arena middle and
